        "subheading_2": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Screens follow us to bed, work follows us home and most of us sleep less than we did ten years ago. <strong>Lights Out</strong> shows you how to set your body clock, build a wind down hour, make the bedroom work for you and what to do when you wake in the night.</p>",
            "enable_custom_style": true,
            "size_desktop": 18,
